{
  "title": "Juicy Pungent Spanish Shrimp Gambas Al Ajillo",
  "description": "A pungent and fluffy one-pot Spanish dish featuring cream and shrimp, made in a kazan cauldron, this gambas al ajillo is a twist on the classic recipe, it is egg-free friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Spanish",
